  "notes": "Bundesagentur für Arbeit, form EzB 02/2024 (AcroForm, 69 fields; still the version served at the official URL on 16.11.2026, same SHA-256). Not stored in the repository: redistribution terms of the BA form are not stated, so an admin installs it once (Admin › Official forms › Install default templates) into private storage — no external fetch happens while an employer or staff member fills the form. Without an installed template the wizard produces a data sheet in the official question order (to copy into the form from arbeitsagentur.de). Not prefilled: residence since (9), degree / training details (26-33, 34 free text), DVKA exemption (54-55).",
